  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of percentage agreement between TBST and TST in studies including participants without active TB, grouped by test pair: C-Tb5mm vs TST5mm 85.95%, C-Tb5mm vs TST15mm 81.61%, DST AI vs TST5mm 47.38%, DST5mm vs TST5mm 41.90% and C-TST vs TST 5mm 59.59%. The overall random-effects pooled agreement is 59.42% (45.34–72.10) across 4857 participants, with wide variation among DST studies.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسبة التوافق بين اختبارات TBST وTST في الدراسات التي شملت مشاركين غير مصابين بالسل النشط، مصنّفة حسب زوج الاختبارات: C-Tb 5 مم مقابل TST 5 مم 85.95%، وC-Tb 5 مم مقابل TST 15 مم 81.61%، وDST AI مقابل TST 5 مم 47.38%، وDST 5 مم مقابل TST 5 مم 41.90%، وC-TST مقابل TST 5 مم 59.59%. ويبلغ التوافق المجمّع الإجمالي 59.42% (45.34–72.10) لدى 4857 مشاركاً، مع تباين واسع بين دراسات DST.",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "森林图显示纳入无活动性结核病参与者的研究中TBST与TST的一致率（%），按检测组合分组：C-Tb5mm对TST5mm 85.95%，C-Tb5mm对TST15mm 81.61%，DST AI对TST5mm 47.38%，DST5mm对TST5mm 41.90%，C-TST对TST 5mm 59.59%。4857名参与者的总体随机效应合并一致率为59.42%（45.34–72.10），DST各研究间差异很大。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diagrama de bosque de la concordancia porcentual entre las TBST y la TST en estudios con participantes sin TB activa, agrupada por par de pruebas: C-Tb 5 mm frente a TST 5 mm 85,95%, C-Tb 5 mm frente a TST 15 mm 81,61%, DST AI frente a TST 5 mm 47,38%, DST 5 mm frente a TST 5 mm 41,90% y C-TST frente a TST 5 mm 59,59%. La concordancia combinada global es del 59,42% (45,34–72,10) en 4857 participantes, con gran variación entre los estudios de DST.",
      "lang": "es",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
